      "score_rate": 35,
      "evalb_memo": "There will be 7 quizzes this semester, each worth 5% of students’ final grade. Each quiz will consist of 10 multiple-choice questions, with a maximum score of 100 points. These quizzes will test students’ knowledge of names, terms, plots, and other details from the texts we read in this course. Please note that students must take their quizzes in class; otherwise, their grades will not be recorded.",
